§§ `Other claims: ships and taxes`

-- s 8(2): 2 years, not extended by being under 18 (s 8(7)); extended by the court (s 8(4)) to 1 January 2022; an
-- "extension" to an earlier day leaves the 2 years.
#ASSERT `special limit` `ship` (`d` 1 7 2019) FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2021)
#ASSERT `special limit` `ship` (`d` 1 7 2019) FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2022)
#ASSERT `special limit` `ship` (`d` 1 7 2019) FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2021) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2021)
-- s 25D(2): 12 months from payment, not extended though under 18 (s 25E); an overpayment: not answered.
#ASSERT `special limit` `tax` (`d` 15 8 2025) FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 15 8 2026)
#ASSERT `special limit` `tax` (`d` 15 8 2025) TRUE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `not answered by this encoding`
-- The same contract claim with the claimant under 18 (born 1 June 2010) gets s 26: 6 years from 1 June 2028.
#ASSERT `special limit` `contract` (`d` 15 8 2025) FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2034)

§§ `Other claims: s 26 and s 27 disability`

-- Born 1 June 2010, accrued 1 June 2020: 6 years from the 18th birthday, 1 June 2034.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `contract` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2034)
-- A deed: 12 years from accrual (1 June 2032) or 6 from 18 (1 June 2034): the later.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `deed` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2034)
-- Accrued on the 18th birthday (born 1 June 2002): not under disability, 1 June 2026; the day before: 6 years from the
-- birthday, 1 June 2026, one day later than the ordinary 31 May 2026.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `contract` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2002) FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2026)
#ASSERT `minor limit` `contract` (`d` 31 5 2020) (`d` 1 6 2002) FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2026)
-- s 26(2): first accrued to a predecessor not under disability: ordinary 1 June 2026.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `contract` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2010) TRUE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2026)
-- Died 1 January 2022 while under 18: 6 years from death, 1 January 2028.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `contract` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2022) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2028)
-- s 27: notice to proceed served 1 March 2021: 1 March 2027.
#ASSERT `minor limit` `contract` (`d` 1 6 2020) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE FALSE `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 3 2021) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2027)
-- An adult incapable at accrual (1 July 2019): ongoing, no last day; ended 1 January 2023: 1 January 2029; ongoing with
-- a notice to proceed on 1 January 2024: 1 January 2030; ended 1 January 2020: 1 January 2026, later than 1 July 2025.
#ASSERT `incapable limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `no last day yet, because the disability or suspension has not ended`
#ASSERT `incapable limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2023) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2029)
#ASSERT `incapable limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) FALSE `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2024) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2030)
#ASSERT `incapable limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2020) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2026)

