§§ `Other claims: ss 29-31 acknowledgement and part payment`

-- A debt accrued 1 July 2019 (6 years to 1 July 2025). Signed acknowledgement by the debtor on 1 March 2024: 1 March 2030;
-- on 1 March 2026, after expiry: 1 March 2032 against the debtor.
#ASSERT `ack limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) TRUE `signed` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2030)
#ASSERT `ack limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) TRUE `signed` (`d` 1 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2032)
-- Payment by another person liable on 1 March 2024 (before expiry): binds, 1 March 2030; on 1 March 2026 (after): 1 July
-- 2025; on the last day, 1 July 2025: binds, 1 July 2031; the day after: does not.
#ASSERT `ack limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) TRUE `payment` (`d` 1 3 2024) FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2030)
#ASSERT `ack limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) TRUE `payment` (`d` 1 3 2026) FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2025)
#ASSERT `ack limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) TRUE `payment` (`d` 1 7 2025) FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2031)
#ASSERT `ack limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) TRUE `payment` (`d` 2 7 2025) FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2025)
-- A signed acknowledgement by someone else, an unsigned one, a non-debt claim: no effect.
#ASSERT `ack limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) TRUE `signed` (`d` 1 3 2024) FALSE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2025)
#ASSERT `ack limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) TRUE `unsigned` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2025)
#ASSERT `ack limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) FALSE `signed` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2025)
-- An estate share (12 years to 1 July 2031) with a payment by the personal representative on 1 March 2024: 1 March 2036.
#ASSERT `ack limit` `estate` (`d` 1 7 2019) FALSE `payment` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2036)

-- The acknowledgement question asked alone.
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE `signed` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE FALSE EQUALS `my right is taken to accrue afresh on` (`d` 1 3 2024)
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE `signed` (`d` 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS `my right is taken to accrue afresh on` (`d` 1 3 2026)
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE `payment` (`d` 1 3 2024) FALSE FALSE EQUALS `my right is taken to accrue afresh on` (`d` 1 3 2024)
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE `payment` (`d` 1 3 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `it does not restart time against the person I would sue`
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE `unsigned` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE FALSE EQUALS `it does not restart time against the person I would sue`
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE `none` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE FALSE EQUALS `it does not restart time against the person I would sue`
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` FALSE `signed` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE FALSE EQUALS `sections 29 to 31 do not restart time for this kind of claim`

§§ `Other claims: commencing on a day`

-- Last day 1 July 2025: that day in time, the next not; before accrual not answered; a trust fraud claim any day;
-- another kind not answered.
#ASSERT `adult in time` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `adult in time` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 2 7 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `adult in time` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 30 6 2019) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `adult in time` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2019) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `adult in time` `trust fraud` (`d` 1 7 1990) (`d` 1 1 2050) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `adult in time` `other kind` (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 1 2020) EQUALS NOTHING

